          "help_en": "Specifies whether to automatically split tracks. This parameter is mostly applicable to single-track recordings. Valid values:\n0: Do not split tracks.\n1: Automatically split tracks.\nDefault value: 1. If you set this parameter to 1, the uploaded audio is considered single-track. Automatic track splitting requires additional processing time. If the recording is dual-track, you must set this parameter to 0",
          "help_zh": "多数情况下适用于单轨录音，取值：0、1，是否自动分轨，1 为自动分轨，0 为不分轨；默认：1；若指定为 1，则表示上传的音频为单轨；自动分轨会额外占用处理时间。若录音为双轨录音，该参数必须传 0",
