          "example": "1",
          "help_en": "Specifies the track number for the customer role. This parameter is applicable to dual-track recordings. Valid values: 0 and 1. Default value: 1, which indicates that Track 1 is the customer. Typically, audio tracks are numbered starting from 0. For two tracks, the numbers are 0 and 1. You must confirm whether Track 0 represents the customer service representative or the customer. If you use this parameter, make sure to pass the autoSplit parameter and set it to 0. This parameter is ignored for single-track files",
          "help_zh": "适用于双轨录音，指定客户角色的轨道编号，取值：0、1，默认 1，即第 1 轨为客户；通常音轨都是从 0 开始编号，2 个轨就是 0，1；具体 0 是客服还是客户，需要您自行确认。若使用此参数，请务必传入 autoSplit 参数，值为 0。单轨文件忽略此参数",
